(7401883, 1165098, 29011, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and the background going all bright. It''s pretty neat. The only nitpick is the texture of the tree. If noise reduction was applied, perhaps leaving the tree out or using less of the effect on it... It takes up so much of the area of the image and appears somewhat smudgy. Cheers on the timing of the capture. It''s a good one!</td>', 'I like the processing and the background going all bright. It''s pretty neat. The only nitpick is the texture of the tree. If noise reduction was applied, perhaps leaving the tree out or using less of the effect on it... It takes up so much of the area of the image and appears somewhat smudgy. Cheers on the timing of the capture. It''s a good one!', '2015-09-02 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
