(7402124, 1165128, 180676, '<td valign="top">Just came back and was reviewing images in this challenge, and browsed past this one even though I didn''t vote since I know who shot it.  Every time I look at it, I like it that much more.  If this doesn''t end up front page...  well, don''t know what I could do, but by golly, it should end up front page!</td>', 'Just came back and was reviewing images in this challenge, and browsed past this one even though I didn''t vote since I know who shot it.  Every time I look at it, I like it that much more.  If this doesn''t end up front page...  well, don''t know what I could do, but by golly, it should end up front page!', '2015-09-03 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
