(7402354, 1164550, 114285, '<td valign="top"><i>I had to plan this trip 2 days in advance, and I was hoping that the announced challenge would somehow fit with a shot of desert or sand somehow, especially since DPL was going on. It turned out to be ''Feathers'', which didn''t help in any way. It was still a great shoot, and now I''m glad I got to use at least one of these shots on DPC :)</i> <br/> <br/>yes don''t you love it when that happens, was always going to win WD!</td>', 'I had to plan this trip 2 days in advance, and I was hoping that the announced challenge would somehow fit with a shot of desert or sand somehow, especially since DPL was going on. It turned out to be ''Feathers'', which didn''t help in any way. It was still a great shoot, and now I''m glad I got to use at least one of these shots on DPC :)  yes don''t you love it when that happens, was always going to win WD!', '2015-09-04 02:27:57.000000', NULL, 0),
