(7402376, 1164837, 37858, '<td valign="top">yep.  They are real.  I was walking in a park and a wedding photographer was taking their picture (he was off-camera tot he left) and I had a 100mm lens on my camera and was behind him when I decided to fire off a couple of handheld shots because I liked the sky in the background.  I know "wedding" photos don''t score very well very often on DPL, but so what.  It''s a nice sky and a nice looking couple.  I don''t do weddings, ever, so this was a change of pace for me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-09-04 03:51:52.</i></td>', 'yep.  They are real.  I was walking in a park and a wedding photographer was taking their picture (he was off-camera tot he left) and I had a 100mm lens on my camera and was behind him when I decided to fire off a couple of handheld shots because I liked the sky in the background.  I know "wedding" photos don''t score very well very often on DPL, but so what.  It''s a nice sky and a nice looking couple.  I don''t do weddings, ever, so this was a change of pace for me.', '2015-09-04 04:51:21.000000', '2015-09-04 04:51:52.000000', 0),
